WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.247
Monday morning at the company.

00:00:02.629 --> 00:00:04.827
Which van is due for a service?

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:11.004
One look at the overview, and it's all clear: what's coming up, for every vehicle!

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.452
The driver snaps a photo of the garage invoice.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.789
And it's already recorded!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:24.056
At year end: costs per vehicle, as a file for the accountant.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.677
And Monday's question?

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.766
It answers itself!

00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:33.090
36 francs per vehicle per year.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.649
Try it free for 30 days!
